king towards it across turns; it\nstays until they clear or replace it.\n\nkeep the tests green\n</goal>\n\n<task_list>\nYour task list when this turn began. If you have called todo_write since, its latest result is the list now.\n[~] [a] read it\n</task_list>\n</turn_context>"},"turn_hold":{"digest":"sha256:6af6e45a8a5ec122cf89e8343a10dc1d26e565027cb8999bd083f78558d7b228"}},"prev_hash":"sha256:402833a29e4f958a08efca7314009aea49818d1825e5a6750601f19a890d1b18","seq":49,"ts":"2026-11-23T15:27:09.669004Z","type":"llm_request","v":1}
